{"@context":["https://litlfred.github.io/folio-assistant/ns/content/v1.jsonld",{"@base":"https://litlfred.github.io/folio/","folio-assistant-core":"https://litlfred.github.io/folio-assistant-core/v0/ns/"}],"@id":"papers/quantum-observable-universe/blocks/rem-wigner-2-coefficient-interpretation","@type":["folio-assistant-core:Remark","doco:Section"],"label":"rem:wigner-2-coefficient-interpretation","kind":"remark","title":"$h/2$ is the isospin midpoint of the Hecke spectrum","uses":["papers/quantum-observable-universe/blocks/prop-wigner-2-coefficient"],"interprets":"papers/quantum-observable-universe/blocks/prop-wigner-2-coefficient","text":"wigner-2-coefficient-interpretation.md","provenance":"authored","html":"<a id=\"rem:wigner-2-coefficient-interpretation\"></a><p>The value <code class=\"language-math math-inline\">h/2</code> is the arithmetic mean of the symmetric eigenvalue <code class=\"language-math math-inline\">q</code> and the antisymmetric eigenvalue <code class=\"language-math math-inline\">-q^{-1}</code>. Self-conjugate partitions occupy the exact isospin midpoint of the Hecke spectrum.</p>\n<p>The proton-neutron crossing is invisible to <code class=\"language-math math-inline\">[3,2,1]</code>. Its trace contribution cancels exactly. Only <code class=\"language-math math-inline\">pp</code> and <code class=\"language-math math-inline\">nn</code> crossings contribute, doing so with opposite signs. The BW scaling for <code class=\"language-math math-inline\">[3,2,1]</code> is therefore proportional to the net <code class=\"language-math math-inline\">pp</code> minus <code class=\"language-math math-inline\">nn</code> asymmetry <code class=\"language-math math-inline\">(Z - N)(A - 1)</code>, rather than the isospin Casimir <code class=\"language-math math-inline\">T(T+1)</code>.</p>\n","source":"folio/quantum-observable-universe/mass-theory/wigner-2-coefficient-interpretation.md","heading":"Remark","number":"13.23.10","page":"b/rem-wigner-2-coefficient-interpretation","qa":{"counts":{"pass":60,"fail":0,"warn":0,"na":17,"unknown":0,"stale":60},"milnor":{"total":2,"notPassing":0}}}
